    67	  <h2><span class="k">01</span>The finding</h2>
    68	  <p>Session state has <strong>three owners</strong> — pi's native transcript, the live pi session
    69	    adapter, and our replay buffer — and the snapshot fabricates a cursor from two unrelated numbering
    70	    schemes:</p>
    71	<pre><code>seq: Math.max(persisted.seq, liveSeq)   // harnessPiChatService.ts, readStateBeforeDispose</code></pre>
    72	  <p><strong>Four owners</strong> under the shipped flag-enabled configuration: the durable event store
    73	    is written before fan-out, supplies the cold snapshot sequence, and rehydrates the replay buffer
    74	    after restart.</p>
    75	
    76	  <h3>What the seam costs</h3>
