    50	5. **Restart model:** same-process resolution may continue the admitted waiter. Across restart, the pending request remains visible but the waiting turn expires/cancels unless a durable continuation journal is implemented later. A seeded new turn is optional recovery and must never be described as transparent resume.
    51	6. ask-user + any permission prompts ride the single approval path — no second channel.
    52	7. Harness conformance additions pass: envelope ordering/replay, transactional approval state, explicit restart recovery, and JSONL-before-event-append fault injection.
